      "body": "Adversarial review in progress at c85f9e58. Confirmed a bounded CLI input defect against the reported binary SHA 2c519887f708d8a27f375df9bc69482d8f38d630f1f2edd09b6ac91d2cd833cc: `uor-r4-stack generate .../claude-s1/export-rtn-1/model.lut 4294967296 0` exits 0 and records `prompt:[0]`. `number(...).map(|v| v as u32)` truncates instead of rejecting. I will repair this in an isolated checkout with a failing regression and preserve the numerical engine. I also found unbounded `Vec::with_capacity(new_tokens)` despite a bounded model context and unchecked `context + windows` in CLI/evaluation validation; these belong to the same bounded input-safety repair. Existing core arithmetic, NoRead, rotation and oracle tests are being reviewed independently; no model promotion is implied.",
